---
// Contacto.astro
---
<section id="contacto" class="py-24 bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-50 to-white relative overflow-hidden border-t border-gray-100">
    <!-- Grid background decoration -->
    <div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-40 bg-[linear-gradient(to_right,#e5e7eb_1px,transparent_1px),linear-gradient(to_bottom,#e5e7eb_1px,transparent_1px)] bg-[size:24px_24px]"></div>
    
    <div class="container mx-auto px-4 relative z-10">
        <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto bg-white border border-gray-100 p-10 md:p-16 rounded-3xl shadow-[0_20px_50px_rgba(0,0,0,0.05)]">
            <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center">
                
                <div class="pr-0 md:pr-8">
                    <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-heading font-black mb-6 text-plai-dark">Hablemos</h2>
                    <p class="text-lg text-gray-600 font-body mb-8 leading-relaxed">
                        Si tienes procesos repetitivos que consumen tiempo, conversemos. Primera reunión sin costo para entender qué necesitas. Propuesta clara con alcances y plazos. Sin letra chica.
                    </p>
                    
                    <ul class="space-y-4 mb-4 font-body text-gray-600 font-medium">
                        <li class="flex items-center gap-3">
                            <span class="flex-shrink-0 w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-blue-100 text-plai-primary flex items-center justify-center text-sm">✓</span> Primera reunión sin costo
                        </li>
                        <li class="flex items-center gap-3">
                            <span class="flex-shrink-0 w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-blue-100 text-plai-primary flex items-center justify-center text-sm">✓</span> Soporte técnico directo con los desarrolladores
                        </li>
                        <li class="flex items-center gap-3">
                            <span class="flex-shrink-0 w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-blue-100 text-plai-primary flex items-center justify-center text-sm">✓</span> Equipo técnico (no agencia de marketing)
                        </li>
                        <li class="flex items-center gap-3">
                            <span class="flex-shrink-0 w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-blue-100 text-plai-primary flex items-center justify-center text-sm">✓</span> Especialistas en Industria Financiera
                        </li>
                        <li class="flex items-center gap-3">
                            <span class="flex-shrink-0 w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-blue-100 text-plai-primary flex items-center justify-center text-sm">✓</span> Conocimiento en infraestructura crítica
                        </li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
                
                <div class="flex flex-col justify-center items-center h-full bg-plai-primary rounded-3xl p-10 text-center text-white shadow-xl relative overflow-hidden">
                    <!-- Decoración interna -->
                    <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 -mt-10 -mr-10 w-40 h-40 bg-white opacity-10 rounded-full blur-2xl"></div>
                    <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 -mb-10 -ml-10 w-40 h-40 bg-white opacity-10 rounded-full blur-2xl"></div>

                    <div class="w-20 h-20 bg-white/20 backdrop-blur-md rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mb-6 border border-white/30 relative z-10">
                        <svg class="w-10 h-10 text-white" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M3 8l7.89 5.26a2 2 0 002.22 0L21 8M5 19h14a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2z"></path></svg>
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="text-3xl font-bold font-heading mb-6 relative z-10">Inicia tu automatización</h3>
                    <a href="mailto:plai@plai.cl" class="bg-white hover:bg-gray-100 text-plai-primary w-full py-4 rounded-xl font-bold text-xl transition-all shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl active:scale-95 text-center block relative z-10">
                        Contactar a Ventas
                    </a>
                </div>
                
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
